            <h1>Propellant Influence on Aerosol Performance: LPG vs DME vs HFC vs CO₂ vs N₂ (Technical Guide)</h1>
            <p>A technically accurate, engineering-focused guide explaining how aerosol propellants control pressure
                behavior, spray force, atomization quality, solvency, safety, and real-world performance.</p>
        </div>
    </header>

